# Keep placeholder files in otherwise ignored output folders when explicitly added.
!**/.gitkeep

# 03_RESULTS is a navigation layer of READMEs and relative symlinks into
# Age_trajectory/results/; track the links even where their names match patterns above.
!03_RESULTS/**

# Age_trajectory/ is the generated pipeline workspace, so everything in it is ignored
# except what is deliberately tracked: its README, results/README.md, and the figures
# (the 03_RESULTS/ symlinks resolve on GitHub because of them). Git cannot re-include
# a file inside an excluded directory, so each level is excluded with `/*` and its
# tracked child re-included. This block sits after the generic `results/` rule above
# so that it can override it.
Age_trajectory/*
!Age_trajectory/README.md
!Age_trajectory/results/
Age_trajectory/results/*
!Age_trajectory/results/README.md
!Age_trajectory/results/figures/
